@startuml scenario-c-inspect-observation
title Scenario C — Biologist inspects an observation image

actor Biologist as B
participant "Dashboard UI" as UI
participant "useObservations" as Obs
participant "useObservationImage" as Img
participant "sensing_garden_client API" as API
database "DynamoDB" as DB
database "S3" as S3

B -> UI : Opens deployment detail
UI -> Obs : useObservations(deploymentId, filters)
Obs -> API : GET /observations?deploymentId=...
API -> DB : SELECT observations
DB --> API : Observation list
API --> Obs : Observations (with imageUrl)
Obs --> UI : Render observation table

B -> UI : Clicks a row
UI -> Img : useObservationImage(observationId)
Img -> API : GET /image/{observationId}
API -> S3 : Fetch image blob
S3 --> API : Image data
API --> Img : Image URL / data
Img --> UI : Modal with photo, species label,\nconfidence score
@enduml
